# Design system — Material UI

Read `.arlox/design-system.json` — this project uses **MUI** (`@mui/material`).

## Rules

- Import from `@mui/material` — use `sx` prop for one-off layout tweaks.
- Theme via `ThemeProvider` in `providers.tsx` — extend with `createTheme()` when needed.
- Do not mix antd, shadcn, or Chakra in the same project.

## Docs

https://mui.com/material-ui/getting-started/
